## 9) Risk, Legal, and Ethics Guardrails\par
\par
Before publishing an incident:\par
- Verify with at least two credible sources where possible.\par
- Redact private/sensitive data.\par
- Avoid naming individuals unless already public and necessary.\par
- Label speculation clearly.\par
- Include correction policy in profile/bio or pinned post.\par
\par
Use this disclaimer pattern:\par
- "This analysis is based on publicly available information as of [date]."\par
\par
